    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkitanapat naabayie naaishoo Daudi Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eaku keye Daudi, neitanap Solomon olayioni lenye; ejo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Etataana enkata ai pee alo aye. Ntagoluoyu niaaku olee, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimbung nkitanapat o Laitoriani Enkai ino, aim inkoitoi enyena, nimbung nkiguanat enyena, o nkitanapat enyena, o nkikoot enyena, o enchakenisho enye, anaa enaigero too nkitanapat e Musa, pee itum atudupayu te pooki niaas o te pooki wueji niim; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pee etum Olaitoriani aitabai ina apa nairoro tialo nanu ejo, ‘Teneing'or ilayiok linono nkoitoi enye, aapuo te dukuya nanu too sipat, too ltauja lenye pooki o te nkishui enye, melai aekata te iyie oltung'ani otonie olorika le nkitoo too Siraeli’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.3.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 3.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore ake sii iyiolo enaaitaasa nanu Yoab olayioni le Seruyia, ina naitaasa ilkituaak oare le njore oo Siraeli, Abna olayioni le Neer o Amasa olayioni le Yeser, oo tasesekuana ninye. Eitalakua ninye te nkata e seriani, elap o sarge apa oibukoyioki to larrabal, nepik osarge lemeeta entioto enkimeita natii empolos ai, nepik inamuka naatii nkejek aainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaasisho naa nabo kata te risioroto e ng'eno inyi, kake emincho ina lukunya enye naibor edoiki enemeneng'a te seriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.17.27+2SA.17.28+2SA.17.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 17.27-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake ntoduaa esupatisho lelo ayiok le Barsilai le Gilead, nincho ninche eaku tenebo lelo oodaa te Misa ino; amu teina supatisho aatang'amutua ninche nanu apa pee aisik ailany Absalom olalashe lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.5+2SA.16.6+2SA.16.7+2SA.16.8+2SA.16.9+2SA.16.10+2SA.16.11+2SA.16.12+2SA.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 16.5-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.16+2SA.19.17+2SA.19.18+2SA.19.19+2SA.19.20+2SA.19.21+2SA.19.22+2SA.19.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.16-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Netii sii tenebo iyie Shimei olayioni le Gera, le Benchamen oing'ua Bahurin, laa ninye apa laatediaa to ldeket torrono teina olong apa nashomo Mahanaim; kake ore ake pee aalotu anang'are nanu to lkeju le Yordan, nainosaki nanu ninye olmumai to Laitoriani, ajoki, ‘Maar nanu iyie tua to lalem.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata eminkenaa ninye aajo meeta entioto, naa ore amu ira iyie oltung'ani ng'en; iyiolo iyie enilo aitaas, niyau iyie ina lukunya enye naibor enemeneng'a etii osarge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keeya e Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirura Daudi anaa loo menye, aye, nenukari ninye te nkanasa e Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.4+2SA.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5.4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 3.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore apa enkata naitoreisho Daudi te Israel naa ilarin artam eitoreishe ninye ilarin tomoni uni oo kuni te Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 29.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku etotona Solomon to lorika le nkitoo le Daudi papaai lenye ore enkitoo enye neitashe auno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keeya e Adonija",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Adonija olayioni le Hagit alotu enetii Betsheba ngotonye Solomon. Nejoki ninye, “Aite seriani iewuo iyie?” Nejo ninye “Teseriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ajo, “Aata embae naaliki iyie.” Nejoki ninye, “Tolimu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Iyiolo iyie ajo enaai apa enkitoria, naa nanu apa eisiligita Israel pooki pee aitore ninche; kake eibelekenye enkitoria neaku eno lalashe lai, amu enenye apake eing'uaa enetii Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata aata embae nabo naomonu te iyie, nimikianyaki iyie nanu.” Nejoki Betsheba ninye, “Tolimu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.1.3+1CH.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 1.3-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo ninye, “Aatoomono nkilikuana olaiguanani Solomon, amu mikianyaki ninye, pee aaisho nanu Abishag e Shunam maitaa enkitok ai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Betsheba, “Eisidai; kairorie olaiguanani te rishata ino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eshomo Betsheba enetii olaiguanani Solomon, pee eirorie ninye te rishata e Adonija. Nedumunye olaiguanani anang'are ninye, neirrugokino ninye, neitoki aton to lorika lenye le nkitoo, neitoki aipotu olorika meyakini ngotonye olaiguanani, neton ninye te nkaina enye e tatene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninye ajo, “Aata enkiti omonunoto nabo naaomon iyie, mikianyaki iyie nanu.” Nejoki olaiguanani ninye, “Tolimu eomonunoto ino yieyio lai, amu maanyaki nanu iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Nchoo Abishag e Shunam meishori Adonija olalashe lino meyama.” Nejoki olaiguanani Solomon ngotonye, “Paa kainyoo peyie aa Abishag e Shunam iomonu meishori Adonija? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toomonoki sii ninye enkitoria; amu olalashe lai botor ninye, ore too matuan enyena netii Abiatar olapolosani o Yoab olayioni le Seruyia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani Solomon ainos olmumai to Laitoriani ejo, “Maaitaasa Olaitoriani ena naaitulus tenemeinosieki ele rorei enkishui e Adonija! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata anaa enaishu Olaitoriani, laa ninye laaitasheyie nanu aitagol, naaitoton nanu to lorika le Daudi papaai lai, laa ninye laaitaa nanu olmarei, anaa apa enaisiligishore, keari Adonija metua ena olong.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eirriwayie olaiguanani Solomon Benaia olayioni le Yehoida; neosh ninye anang'ie enkop, neye ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eararoto e Abiatar o keeya e Yoab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
