            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.20+1SA.22.21+1SA.22.22+1SA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22.20-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.15.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 15.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore tialo Abiatar olapolosani, nejo olaiguanani, “Shomo Anasot, enkop inyi amu keeya nikiririkino iyie. Kake maar nanu iyie tua tena kata, amu itanapa apa osanduku lo Laitoriani te dukuya Daudi papaai lai, o enkaraki sii nitang'arie apa papa isinaitin lenyena pooki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.27+1SA.2.28+1SA.2.29+1SA.2.30+1SA.2.31+1SA.2.32+1SA.2.33+1SA.2.34+1SA.2.35+1SA.2.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2.27-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku etaarayie Solomon Abiatar pee meitoki aaku olapolosani lo Laitoriani, neitabaya ororei lo Laitoriani apa oiroro ninye eipirta enkaji e Eli te Shilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ebaiki ilomon Yoab, amu etijing'a apa Yoab Adonija enkoriong, hoo neitu ejing Absalom, neisikaki Yoab olng'obor lo Laitoriani nelo aibung imouarak o lperere lo lasar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elikini olaiguanani Solomon, nchere, “Eisika Yoab alo atua olng'obor lo Laitoriani, naa ng'ura, etii ninye embata olperere lo lasar.” Neirriwaa Solomon Benaia olayioni le Yehoida, ejo, “Shomo toosho ninye tanang'ie enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eshomo Benaia atua ilo ng'obor lo Laitoriani nejoki ninye, “Eitanapishe olaiguanani ejo, ‘Tupuku’ ” kake etejo ninye, “A'a tene nanu aye.” Neitoki Benaia ayaki olaiguanani olomoni ajoki, “Nji ejo Yoab naa ena einosa olmumai ajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki olaiguanani ninye ajoki, “Taasa anaa enatejo ninye toosho ninye tanang'ie enkop, nilo anukaa; pee eiwuang'ieki te nanu o te nkaji e papaai lai entorroni o sarge lemeeta entioto oibukoyie Yoab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau Olaitoriani arrinyu nkiasin enyena e nkibukoroto o sarge shumata endukuya enye makewan, amu ore apa meyiolo papa Daudi, etarasaka ninye nesesekuan to lalem iltung'ana oare supati naa iletipat aalang ninye, Abna olayioni le Neer, ilo kitok le njore oo Siraeli o Amasa olayioni le Yeter, olkitok le njore e Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku kerrinyunye isargeta lenye aapuonu shumata endukuya e Yoab o shumata oo lukuny eishoi enye, intarasi; kake ore tialo Daudi, o eishoi enye o enkaji enye o lorika lenye le nkitoo, naa keaku eseriani naing'uaa Olaitoriani ntarasi moitie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Benaia olayioni le Yehoida alo neosh ninye anang'ie enkop, near ninye metua, nenukari ninye tiatua enkaji enye makewan tiong'ota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik olaiguanani Benaia olayioni le Yehoida aitaa olkitok le njore te rishata e Yoab, nepik olaiguanani Sadok metaa olapolosani terishata e Abiatar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keeya e Shimei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani airriwaa olkilikuai aipotu Shimei nejoki, ninye, “Teshetaki kewan enkaji te Yerusalem, nibik teine, nimilo iyie teine aidurraki dikae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore akenya enkolong nilo, alang enongoto e Kebron, tayiolo ntisipa nchere meeta nchere miye. Ore osarge lino nelotu shumata endukuya ino makewan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Shemei olaiguanani, “Ore ina nitejo iyie naa eisidai; ore anaa enatejo olkitok lai olaiguanani, ina elo osinka lino aas.” Neaku etobiko Shimei te Yerusalem nkolong'i kumok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore etulusoitie ilarin okuni, neisik irrindiki oare le Shimei aapuo enetii Akish olayioni le Maaka, olaiguanani le Gaat. Ore pee elikini Shimei aajoki, “Ng'ura etii irrindiki linono Gaat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Shimei neirot osikiria nelo Gaat enetii Akish, aing'oru irrindiki lenyena; nelo Shimei arrinyu irrindiki lenyena te Gaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elikini Solomon aajoki eshomo Shimei te Yerusalem nelo Gaat neitoki arrinyunye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neirriwaa olaiguanani olkilikuai aipotu Shimei, nejoki ninye “Keitu apa nanu aainosie iyie olmumai to Laitoriani, naairorie oleng aikok ajoki, ‘Tayiolo ntisipa nchere ore akenya enkolong nilo ake ninye dikae wueji, niye iyie?’ Nikijoki iyie nanu, ‘Ore enitejo naa eisidai; kairuk nanu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo naa peyie eitu iyie imbung olmumai to Laitoriani oina kitanapata naaitanapa nanu iyie?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake sii olaiguanani ajoki Shimei, “Iyiolo iyie to ltau lino ina torroni apa nintaasa Daudi papa lai; neaku kerrinyu Olaitoriani entorroni ino shumata endukuya ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake kemayian Olaitoriani olaiguanani Solomon, ore olorika le nkitoo le Daudi neitasheyieki te dukuya Olaitoriani ntarasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani aitanap Benaia olayioni le Yehoida; neipang ninye alo aosh ninye anang'ie enkop, neye ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
